%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date 2026-07-24
%% @type state
%% @level system
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ValidationStart: Start validation
    
    ValidationStart --> SchemaValidation: Validate schema
    ValidationStart --> Failed: Validation start failed
    
    SchemaValidation --> SchemaValid: Schema valid
    SchemaValidation --> SchemaInvalid: Schema invalid
    
    SchemaValid --> RuleEvaluation: Apply DQ rules
    SchemaInvalid --> Failed: Schema validation failed
    
    RuleEvaluation --> RuleComplete: Rules applied
    RuleEvaluation --> Failed: Rule evaluation failed
    
    RuleComplete --> ThresholdCheck: Evaluate thresholds
    RuleComplete --> Warning: Rules applied with warnings
    
    ThresholdCheck --> ThresholdPass: All MUST thresholds pass
    ThresholdCheck --> ThresholdFail: MUST threshold fails
    ThresholdCheck --> ThresholdWarning: SHOULD thresholds fail
    
    ThresholdPass --> DQScore: Calculate DQ score
    ThresholdFail --> Quarantine: Route to quarantine
    ThresholdWarning --> DQScore: Calculate DQ score
    
    DQScore --> HighScore: High DQ score
    DQScore --> MediumScore: Medium DQ score
    DQScore --> LowScore: Low DQ score
    
    HighScore --> StandardRouting: Route to standard storage
    MediumScore --> StandardRouting: Route to standard storage with warning
    LowScore --> Quarantine: Route to quarantine
    
    StandardRouting --> Success: DQ validation success
    StandardRouting --> StorageError: Storage write failed
    
    Warning --> Success: DQ validation with warnings
    Warning --> StorageError: Storage write failed
    
    Quarantine --> QuarantineHandling: Handle quarantined data
    QuarantineHandling --> QuarantineComplete: Quarantine handling complete
    QuarantineHandling --> QuarantineError: Quarantine handling failed
    
    QuarantineComplete --> Quarantined: Data quarantined
    QuarantineError --> Failed: Quarantine handling failed
    
    StorageError --> Failed: Storage write failed
    
    Success --> ValidationComplete: Validation complete
    Quarantined --> ValidationComplete: Validation complete
    Failed --> ValidationComplete: Validation failed
    
    ValidationComplete --> [*]: End validation
    
    note right of ValidationStart
        DQ validation initiated
        Batch data to validate
    end note
    
    note right of SchemaValidation
        Validate against Pydantic schema
        Data type and constraint checks
    end note
    
    note right of RuleEvaluation
        Apply DQ rules from external config
        Completeness, accuracy, consistency
    end note
    
    note right of ThresholdCheck
        Evaluate DQ thresholds
        MUST/SHOULD/MAY severity
    end note
    
    note right of DQScore
        Calculate overall DQ score
        Based on rule results
    end note
    
    note right of HighScore
        High DQ score
        All critical rules pass
    end note
    
    note right of MediumScore
        Medium DQ score
        SHOULD rules fail
    end note
    
    note right of LowScore
        Low DQ score
        MUST rules fail
    end note
    
    note right of StandardRouting
        Route to standard storage
        Silver/Gold writes
    end note
    
    note right of Quarantine
        Route to quarantine storage
        Failed DQ validation
    end note
    
    note right of Success
        DQ validation successful
        Data written to storage
    end note
    
    note right of Quarantined
        Data quarantined
        Manual review required
    end note
    
    note right of Failed
        DQ validation failed
        Terminal state
    end note
